ng Bukhansan National Park","city":"seoul","category":"things-to-do","neighbourhood":"Jongno","neighbourhoodSlug":"jamsil","priceRange":"Free","nearestMetro":"Gupabal (Line 3)","openingHours":"Sunrise – Sunset","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?w=1200&q=80","summary":"Granite peaks and temple trails on the northern edge of Seoul.","intro":"Bukhansan is the dramatic granite mountain visible from almost anywhere in northern Seoul. Multiple trails wind through forests and past Buddhist temples to summit ridges with panoramic city views. It's one of the most visited national parks in the world — for good reason.","venues":[{"name":"Baegundae Peak Trail","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?w=600&q=80","description":"The most popular trail to Bukhansan's highest point (836m). The final section involves steel cables and rock scrambling — exhilarating but not for the faint-hearted.","address":"Bukhansan National Park, Gangbuk-gu","tip":"Start before 7 AM on weekends to beat the crowds. Bring gloves for the cable section.","priceLevel":"Free"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-street-food-myeongdong"],"tags":["Hiking","Nature","Free"],"authorSlug":"mina-park","updatedDate":"2026-02-20","contentType":"guide"}}],["$","$L10","streetwear-hongdae",{"guide":{"slug":"streetwear-hongdae","title":"Where to Shop for Streetwear in Hongdae","city":"seoul","category":"things-to-do","neighbourhood":"Hongdae","neighbourhoodSlug":"hongdae","priceRange":"₩₩ – ₩₩₩","nearestMetro":"Hongik University (Line 2)","openingHours":"11 AM – 9 PM","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?w=1200&q=80","summary":"The best streetwear and vintage shops in Hongdae — from local labels to thrift finds.","intro":"Hongdae's indie spirit shows in its fashion. Alongside global brands you'll find local designers, vintage stores and one-off pieces. Here are the spots worth hitting.","venues":[{"name":"Worksout","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556821840-3a63f95609a7?w=600&q=80","description":"Korean streetwear brand with a flagship in Hongdae. Minimal cuts and limited drops.","address":"Wausan-ro 29na-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Check their Instagram for pop-ups and collabs.","priceLevel":"₩₩₩"},{"name":"Vintage Santa","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558769132-cb1aeaede002?w=600&q=80","description":"Curated vintage and secondhand streetwear. Good for denim and graphic tees.","address":"Wausan-ro 21-gil, Mapo-gu","tip":"Go on a weekday for less crowd.","priceLevel":"₩₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-bars-hongdae","cafes-gangnam"],"tags":["Shopping","Streetwear","Vintage"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}],["$","$L10","pc-bang-gaming-seoul",{"guide":{"slug":"pc-bang-gaming-seoul","title":"Top PC Bang Internet Cafes in Seoul for Gaming","city":"seoul","category":"things-to-do","neighbourhood":"","neighbourhoodSlug":"","priceRange":"₩","nearestMetro":"Various","openingHours":"24 hours (most)","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?w=1200&q=80","summary":"Where to find the best PC bangs in Seoul — high-spec rigs, cheap hourly rates and a slice of Korean gaming culture.","intro":"PC bangs (PC rooms) are a staple of Korean youth culture. For a few thousand won an hour you get a high-end PC, fast internet and often free drinks. Here are solid options across Seoul.","venues":[{"name":"Nexon Arena","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?w=600&q=80","description":"Premium PC bang with top-tier hardware. Popular for League of Legends and FPS games.","address":"Gangnam-gu","tip":"Membership can save money if you're staying a while.","priceLevel":"₩"},{"name":"Challenger's League","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?w=600&q=80","description":"Chain PC bang with locations across Seoul. Clean, well-maintained and affordable.","address":"Multiple locations","tip":"Late night and early morning rates are often cheaper.","priceLevel":"₩"}],"relatedSlugs":["best-bars-hongdae","cafes-gangnam"],"tags":["Gaming","PC Bang","Culture"],"authorSlug":"james-jeong","updatedDate":"2026-03-10","contentType":"guide"}}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6","children":"Venues"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3","children":[["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/venues/baegundae-peak","className":"group flex gap-3 sm:gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-card transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-secondary/50","style":{"boxShadow":"var(--shadow-card)"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0","children":["$","$L11",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551632811-561732d1e306?w=1200&q=80","alt":"Baegundae Peak Trail","width":96,"height":96,"className":"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex-1 min-w-0","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground truncate","children":"Baegundae Peak Trail"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-primary font-medium mt-0.5 capitalize","children":"attraction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1 line-clamp-2","children":"The most popular trail to Bukhansan's highest point at 836 metres with panoramic city views."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"Free"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[10px] text-muted-foreground","children":"jamsil"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/south-korea/seoul/venues/lotte-world-mall-jamsil","className":"grou